<title>DENMARK: Kommunekredit raises 2002 four percent bond amount.</title>
<headline>Kommunekredit raises 2002 four percent bond amount.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish borrower Kommunekredit has raised the amount of its existing four percent 2002 bond by 38.7 million crowns to 2.097515 billion, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The paper was all sold, it added.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
